  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Divine Doctor Sheng Shou tells Wu Shen Tong that once Jade sky Gu’s poison seeps into the bone marrow it cannot be removed.",
        "chapters": [
          386
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_divine_doctor_sheng_shou",
          "char_wu_shen_tong"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At a weakened zone of the three kings blessed land, Long Qing Tian activates Jade sky Gu to spread poison and open a passage to the outside world.",
        "chapters": [
          387
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_long_qing_tian"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan finds him already surrounded by jade-green poison and can only fight at long range.",
        "chapters": [
          388
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later explorers find the green-dyed corpse and run toward it for loot. In less than ten steps their poison reacts and they turn into green light and dissipate. The poison has gotten very deep, the region is almost finished and completely rotten, and narration says the loophole it forms will be even greater than the one Xiao Mang created.",
        "chapters": [
          391
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "poison-spread",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_xiao_mang"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan kills Long Qing Tian before the Gu is used. The loot is a dark green bamboo stem, palm-sized and hollow, with a jade-like texture. It is rank five Jade sky Gu from the immemorial era.",
        "chapters": [
          400
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "post-redo-seizure",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
